OL,3,GNEWSANew community support hub opens
OL,4,Aits doors in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new drop-in centre that aims to bring
OL,7,Fjobs, skills, health and community
OL,8,Fsupport under one roof is opening its
OL,9,Fdoors on Friday.
OL,11,FThe Peterborough Citizen Hub, in Bridge
OL,12,FStreet, hopes people living and working
OL,13,Fin the city will help shape the future
OL,14,Fof the service.
OL,16,FThe site, which will be open Monday to
OL,17,FFriday from 10:00 and 16:00, will be
OL,18,Fthe third Citizen Hub in the UK, with
OL,19,Fothers in St Neots, Cambridgeshire, and
OL,20,FWimbledon, London.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
