OL,3,GNEWSANew community support hub opens
OL,4,Aits doors in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis Vernum, a director of the hub,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Citizen Hub gives [residents]
OL,8,Fthat place - an open door on Bridge
OL,9,FStreet for anyone who wants to give
OL,10,Fsomething or needs something."
